MatrixSchubert -- matrix Schubert varieties and ASM varieties
*************************************************************

Description
===========

This package provides functions for constructing and investigating matrix
Schubert varieties. Many of the functions in this package can take as input
either a permutation in 1-line notation, or an alternating sign matrix.

  * [CV20] Aldo Conca and Matteo Varbaro, Square-free Gröbner degenerations
    (see https://arxiv.org/abs/1805.11923 ), Inventiones mathematicae, 221(3),
    pp.713-730.
  * [Ful92] William Fulton, Flags, Schubert polynomials, degeneracy loci, and
    determinantal formulas (see
    https://sites.math.washington.edu/~billey/classes/schubert.library/fulton.
    essential.set.pdf ), Duke Math J. 65 (1992): 381-420.
  * [KM05] Allen Knutson and Ezra Miller, Gröbner geometry of Schubert
    polynomials (see https://arxiv.org/abs/math/0110058 ), Annals of
    Mathematics (2005): 1245-1318.
  * [KW21] Patricia Klein and Anna Weigandt, Bumpless pipe dreams encode
    Gröbner geometry of Schubert polynomials (see
    https://arxiv.org/abs/2108.08370 ), arxiv preprint 2108.08370.
  * [PSW24] Oliver Pechenik, David Speyer, and Anna Weigandt,
    Castelnuovo-Mumford regularity of matrix Schubert varieties (see
    https://arxiv.org/abs/2111.10681 ), Selecta Mathematica New Series 30, 66
    (2024).
  * [Wei17] Anna Weigandt, Prism tableaux for alternating sign matrix varieties
    (see https://arxiv.org/abs/1708.07236 ), arXiv preprint 1708.07236.

