|                                      |
|o6 : Ideal of QQ[z   ..z   ]          |
|                  1,1   6,6           |
+--------------------------------------+
|i7 : numgens I                        |
|                                      |
|o7 = 16                               |
+--------------------------------------+
|i8 : numgens (trim I)                 |
|                                      |
|o8 = 14                               |
+--------------------------------------+

