This package also contains methods for investigating antidiagonal initial
ideals (*note antiDiagInit: antiDiagInit,) of Schubert determinantal ideals and
their associated Stanley-Reisner complexes, which are a kind of subword complex
(*note subwordComplex: subwordComplex,). Subword complexes were introduced in
[KM05] in the study of antidiagonal initial ideal of Schubert determinantal
ideals and their relation to Schubert polynomials.

