Functions for investigating matrix Schubert varieties
=====================================================

  * *note antiDiagInit(List): antiDiagInit, -- compute the (unique)
    antidiagonal initial ideal of an ASM ideal
  * *note rankTable(List): rankTable, -- compute a table of rank conditions
    that determines the corresponding ASM or matrix Schubert variety
  * *note rotheDiagram(List): rotheDiagram, -- find the Rothe diagram of a
    partial alternating sign matrix
  * *note augmentedRotheDiagram(List): augmentedRotheDiagram, -- find the Rothe
    diagram and rank table for a partial ASM or permutation
  * *note essentialSet(List): essentialSet, -- compute the essential set in the
    Rothe Diagram for a partial ASM or a permutation.
  * *note augmentedEssentialSet(List): augmentedEssentialSet, -- find the
    essential set and rank conditions for a partial ASM or a permutation
  * *note schubertDeterminantalIdeal(List): schubertDeterminantalIdeal, --
    compute an alternating sign matrix ideal (for example, a Schubert
    determinantal ideal)
  * *note fultonGens(List): fultonGens, -- compute the Fulton generators of an
    ASM ideal (for example, a Schubert determinantal ideal)
  * *note subwordComplex(List): subwordComplex, -- to find the subword complex
    associated to w
  * *note schubertIntersect(List): schubertIntersect, -- compute the
    intersection of ASM ideals
  * *note schubertAdd(List): schubertAdd, -- compute the sum of ASM ideals
  * *note schubertRegularity(List): schubertRegularity, -- compute the
    Castelnuovo-Mumford regularity of the quotient by an ASM ideal
  * *note schubertCodim(List): schubertCodim, -- compute the codimension (i.e.,
    height) of a Schubert determinantal ideal or ASM ideal
-------------------------------------------------------------------------------

